cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the dataset or the results, please cite it as below."
title: "Ground Truth Landslide Assessment: landslide type and size from a ground-level phone photo"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: DhmalTPS
repository-code: "https://github.com/DhmalTPS/Ground-Truth-Landslide-Assessment"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/dhmaltps/ground-truth-landslide-data"
abstract: >-
  Field web app and research code that classifies the landslide type (Hungr, Leroueil and
  Picarelli 2014) from a ground-level photo with linear heads on frozen DINOv2 and SigLIP2
  features, estimates the landslide's size, and gives on-site guidance. Test split: 263 usable
  photos from 152 sites, accuracy 0.806, macro-F1 0.784 (agreement with AI-made labels).
keywords:
  - landslides
  - image classification
  - geotechnical engineering
  - DINOv2
  - field app
date-released: "2026-11-22"
references:
  - type: article
    authors:
      - family-names: Hungr
        given-names: Oldrich
      - family-names: Leroueil
        given-names: Serge
      - family-names: Picarelli
        given-names: Luciano
    title: "The Varnes classification of landslide types, an update"
    journal: Landslides
    volume: 11
    start: 167
    end: 194
    year: 2014
    doi: "10.1007/s10346-013-0436-y"
